---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${SITE.author}  - software engineer, startup founder.`}>
  <div class="about container">
    <h1 class="about__title">About</h1>

    <div class="about__content prose">
      <p>
        I'm {SITE.author}  - software engineer, startup founder, habitual overthinker.
      </p>

      <p>
        I build software for a living and think about everything else in between.
        This blog is where those thoughts end up  - sometimes technical, sometimes personal,
        sometimes just opinions I needed to get out of my head.
      </p>

      <p>What you'll find here:</p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Tech</strong>  - engineering deep-dives, tools, and things I've built</li>
        <li><strong>Startup</strong>  - the messy reality of building a company</li>
        <li><strong>Opinions</strong>  - takes on industry, culture, and whatever else</li>
        <li><strong>Life</strong>  - travel, food, and the non-code parts of existence</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        Find me on <a href={SITE.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        or subscribe to the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}rss.xml`}>RSS feed</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-5) var(--space-10);
  }

  .about__title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }
</style>
